# Downloaded runtime binaries are large (~50 MB of DLLs on Windows) and are
# rebuilt by build_runtimes.py in ~20 s. They must never be committed.
#
# MANIFEST.sha256 is also ignored on purpose: it records the digests of
# binaries that are not in the repository, so it would only ever be a file
# that describes files nobody can see.
bin/
__pycache__/
*.pyc